[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0283","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0283.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0337","title":"Sun Solaris Xsun 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris 7.0 和 8.0 系统中的 Xsun X 服务器存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向 Xsun 的 -dev 参数传递超长字符串触发缓冲区溢出，成功利用此漏洞可获得 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Solaris 7.0 及 8.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，无需身份认证即可实施攻击，完全控制目标系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0337"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-24T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:30.407","remediation":"立即安装 Solaris 7 的 Xsun 补丁 106577-xx（或 Solaris 8 的 108652-xx），可从 Oracle 支持网站下载。如无法打补丁，限制本地用户对 Xsun 二进制文件的执行权限（chmod 750 /usr/openwin/bin/Xsun），并移除不必要的 SUID 位作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0188.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1140","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19876","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/528991f6906b29893dd0e43e65862cd92fd607c8/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0337.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0337","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0337.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2c577e1255b2c3fd617b7f1c499a222feb7b668/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0337.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jmw3-v7qc-2gx9/GHSA-jmw3-v7qc-2gx9.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0337.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--398c3ef0-479c-476b-b1d6-74c36998956f.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0283.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0283.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0283.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0267","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0267.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0322","title":"Red Hat Piranha 虚拟服务器套件 passwd.php3 任意命令执行漏洞","description":"Red Hat Piranha 虚拟服务器套件中的 passwd.php3 CGI 脚本存在命令注入漏洞，本地攻击者可通过在输入参数中注入 shell 元字符（如分号、管道符等）绕过输入过滤，导致任意命令执行。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Piranha 虚拟服务器套件，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。攻击者需具有本地访问权限，利用难度较低，Metasploit 框架已集成对应利用模块。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0322"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-24T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:28.470","remediation":"升级 Red Hat Piranha Virtual Server Package 至修复版本，或删除 passwd.php3 脚本。如无法升级，在 Apache 配置中限制该脚本仅允许本地访问（如 <Location /passwd.php3> Deny from all </Location>），并对用户输入做严格过滤，禁止 shell 元字符（; | & $ `）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-014.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1149","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Enip.BSO.23.0004241601140.28851-100000%40www.whitehats.com","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/16858","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86060d5336eceede57f01ccb65fb3037638af8db/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0322.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0322","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0322.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0322.json","https://github.com/gottburgm/Exploits/blob/fd340a05cbec416e89bfae898e27bf5fcb429101/MSFExploits/PIRANHA/MSF/PasswdExec_infos.txt","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cxxx-c74v-hjm6/GHSA-cxxx-c74v-hjm6.json","https://github.com/Chudry/Xerror/blob/07ec57cabcd27cdb47c89af452bdf4ed07207347/xerror/parsing/msf_module_result/msf_module_cve.txt","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/sid-msg.map","https://github.com/openctibr/threatFeeds/blob/df98cd885e49b66ef39b05ac11ddad1b492edabf/ExploitableVulnerabilitiesFeed.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0267.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0267.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0267.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0266","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0266.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0317","title":"Sun Solaris lpset 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris 2.6 及 7.0 系统中的 lpset 命令存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地用户可通过向 -r 选项传递超长字符串参数触发该漏洞，导致攻击者能够获取 root 权限。该漏洞源于 lpset 程序在处理命令行参数时未正确检查输入长度，造成栈缓冲区溢出。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，无需其他特殊条件即可利用。CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0317"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-24T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:27.843","remediation":"升级到 Solaris 8 GA 或更高版本（包括 Solaris 9、10、11），安装 Sun Microsystems/Oracle 发布的最终安全补丁包。目前 Solaris 7 已停止官方支持，建议迁移到现代 Solaris 版本。如无法立即升级，可使用群集安全管理工具限制本地用户权限，或通过修改权限属性（setuid）禁用对 lpset 命令的 root 访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0192.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0236.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95729763119559&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1138","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19874","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/56b9e9b42ce0a91a448094549973b81cdf8e832e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0317.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0317","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0317.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/61756b9c4d4c30577cc003b0b28e3db71ca30a1e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0317.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jhp4-7rfr-4p9v/GHSA-jhp4-7rfr-4p9v.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0317.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1138/info.html","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--4f424782-69a1-4bf0-abf0-c864d936a21b.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0266.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0265","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0265.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0316","title":"Solaris lp 命令 -d 选项缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris 操作系统中 lp 命令的 -d 选项存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向 -d 参数传递超长字符串触发栈溢出，覆盖返回地址后获得 root 权限，从而实现权限提升。该漏洞影响 Solaris 2.6 及 7.0 版本，利用需要系统本地访问权限，无需用户交互即可完成攻击。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0316"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-24T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:27.727","remediation":"升级 Solaris 至 7.0 以上已修复版本，或安装 Sun 补丁 106980-01 (SPARC) / 106981-01 (x86)。临时缓解措施：以 root 执行 `chmod 4555 /usr/bin/lp` 移除 lp 的 setuid 位，或限制本地用户对 lp 命令的访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0191.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1143","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19878","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/56b9e9b42ce0a91a448094549973b81cdf8e832e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0316.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0316","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0316.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/61756b9c4d4c30577cc003b0b28e3db71ca30a1e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0316.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-38cr-66jj-phh5/GHSA-38cr-66jj-phh5.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/S/solaris26_x86_106236.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0316.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/solaris7_x86_107116.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0265.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0319","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0319.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0319","title":"Sendmail mail.local 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Sendmail 8.10.x 版本中的 mail.local 组件在处理邮件消息时未能正确识别标识消息文本结束的 \".\\n\" 字符串，存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过发送一条长度为 2047 字符且以 \".\\n\" 结尾的特制邮件消息行，触发该漏洞，导致目标系统邮件服务拒绝服务或邮箱数据损坏。该漏洞影响 Sendmail 8.10.x 系列版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0319"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-23T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:28.097","remediation":"升级至 Sendmail 8.11.0 及以上版本。当前最新稳定版为 8.18.2，可从 ftp.sendmail.org 获取。如无法升级，可通过防火墙限制对 SMTP 端口（25/tcp）的访问来源，仅允许受信任的邮件服务器连接，减少外部攻击面。同时建议监控 mail.local 日志中异常长的邮件行。对于已废弃的旧系统，建议迁移至维护中的邮件传输代理。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1146","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=2694.000424%40SECURITY.NNOV.RU","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86060d5336eceede57f01ccb65fb3037638af8db/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0319.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0319","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0319.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/61756b9c4d4c30577cc003b0b28e3db71ca30a1e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0319.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rc63-j49f-5vh2/GHSA-rc63-j49f-5vh2.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/sendmail_maillocal_dos.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_300_400.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001312.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--1a7467c6-a760-465e-a2ba-1207a1b1e29d.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0fd457792fb1cd691782f7f666089ea3f91260d9/2000/CVE-2000-0319.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0319.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0285","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0285.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0338","title":"Concurrent Versions Software CVS 可预测临时文件名本地拒绝服务漏洞","description":"CVS 1.10.7 版本在文件锁定机制中使用可预测的临时文件名，本地攻击者可通过在合法 CVS 用户创建锁目录之前预先创建同名目录，导致锁定操作失败，从而引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 CVS 1.10.7 及可能更早版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，无需特殊权限即可利用，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0338"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-23T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:30.520","remediation":"升级 CVS 至 1.11 或更高版本，该版本已修复可预测临时文件名问题，使用随机化锁文件名称防止本地拒绝服务攻击。如无法升级，可限制本地用户对 CVS 仓库目录的访问权限，仅允许受信任用户执行 CVS 操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1136","http://www.securityfocus.com/frames/?content=/templates/archive.pike%3Flist%3D1%26msg%3D20000423174038.A520%40clico.pl","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19870","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0338.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0338","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0338.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2c577e1255b2c3fd617b7f1c499a222feb7b668/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0338.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5fxq-3r3p-42m4/GHSA-5fxq-3r3p-42m4.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_0_100.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-412.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0285.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0285.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0285.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0511","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0511.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0459","title":"IMP MSWordView 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"IMP up to 2.2 Pre12 版本的 MSWordView 应用程序存在文件清理漏洞。当应用程序异常退出时，无法正确删除文档处理过程中产生的临时文件。攻击者可通过反复打开大量文档并提前中断请求，导致系统积累大量未处理的临时文件，逐渐填满磁盘空间，引发拒绝服务攻击，使正常用户无法使用该应用程序。该漏洞影响广泛部署的 IMP 软件中的 MSWordView 模块，由于涉及本地用户权限，攻击者可轻松利用此缺陷破坏系统可用性，尤其在磁盘空间有限的环境中威胁性更大。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0459"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-22T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:46.800","remediation":"建议升级 IMP 到 2.2 Pre12 及以上版本（该版本已修复 MSWordView 退出时未清理临时文件的问题）。若无法立即升级，可配置定时任务定期清理 /tmp 目录下 MSWordView 遗留的临时文件（如 /tmp/mswv_*），或限制单用户最大磁盘配额防止磁盘被填满导致拒绝服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95672120116627&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1361","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0459.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0459","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0459.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c52ac29e3e33d673083c7aada18d2fe25f185ca8/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0459.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6cjc-9cq5-fc4r/GHSA-6cjc-9cq5-fc4r.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0459.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0459.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--904c9cfb-5b32-46a1-bbe7-e7d08990a7f9.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001311.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0511.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0507","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0507.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0458","title":"IMP MSWordView /tmp文件权限不当导致本地信息泄露漏洞","description":"IMP/MSWordView 应用程序存在严重的文件权限漏洞。该应用创建的临时文件存储在 /tmp 目录，并设置了世界可读权限，导致任何本地用户均可访问这些临时文件，读取其中存储的敏感信息。这种漏洞源于不安全的文件权限配置，暴露了用户的隐私数据、配置信息和日志记录。攻击者可利用此漏洞读取系统内的敏感信息，可能导致信息泄漏和进一步安全风险。该漏洞影响 IMP/MSWordView 应用的用户及本地系统账户，攻击条件简单，只需获得本地访问权限即可轻易读取临时文件中的敏感数据。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0458"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-22T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:46.667","remediation":"建议升级 IMP (Internet Messaging Program) 至 2.2 版本或更高版本，该版本已修复 MSWordView 在 /tmp 目录创建全局可读文件的问题。若无法立即升级，可通过设置 /tmp 目录粘滞位 (chmod +t /tmp) 或配置 MSWordView 使用用户私有临时目录 (设置 TMPDIR 环境变量指向 $HOME/tmp 并 chmod 700) 作为临时缓解措施，限制本地用户读取临时文件内容。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95672120116627&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1360","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0458.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0458","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0458.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c52ac29e3e33d673083c7aada18d2fe25f185ca8/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0458.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j88w-3rg6-x4gj/GHSA-j88w-3rg6-x4gj.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0458.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0458.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001310.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0507.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0321","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0321.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0320","title":"Qualcomm Qpopper 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Qualcomm Qpopper 2.53 及 3.0 版本 POP3 服务器在处理邮件消息时存在输入验证缺陷。当攻击者发送一条长度恰好为 1023 个字符且以 \\n 结尾的特制邮件消息时，程序内部的 fgets 函数无法正确识别消息结束标识，导致缓存处理异常，进而引发拒绝服务或邮箱数据损坏。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标服务器的 110 端口投递恶意邮件触发该漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0320"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-21T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:28.230","remediation":"升级 Qpopper 至 3.0.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 fgets 函数对消息行尾 \\n 字符串的错误识别问题。如无法升级，可在 POP3 服务前端部署内容过滤规则，拦截长度超过 1023 字节且以 \\n 结尾的异常邮件行，或限制单封邮件最大行长度以缓解拒绝服务攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1133","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=9763.000421%40SECURITY.NNOV.RU","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86060d5336eceede57f01ccb65fb3037638af8db/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0320.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0320","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0320.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0320.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/qpopper_euidl.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5vvr-mcc4-v73q/GHSA-5vvr-mcc4-v73q.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_300_400.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0320.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001309.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0321.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0317","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0317.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0318","title":"Atrium Mercur Mail Server 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Atrium Mercur Mail Server 3.2 存在路径遍历漏洞，本地攻击者通过在请求中注入 `../` 序列可突破目录限制，越权读取其他用户的电子邮件内容，并在服务器上创建任意文件。该漏洞根因在于软件对用户提交的文件路径参数缺乏充分的合法性校验，攻击者无需高权限即可利用此漏洞窃取敏感邮件数据或破坏系统文件，影响服务器数据机密性与完整性。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0318"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-21T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:27.977","remediation":"升级 Atrium Mercur Mail Server 至 3.2 以上版本以修复路径遍历漏洞；若无法升级，在服务器端严格限制本地用户对邮件存储目录的访问权限，并通过应用程序层对用户输入的文件路径参数进行规范化校验，过滤 \"..\" 等目录穿越字符。同时建议以最小权限原则运行邮件服务进程，避免其拥有过高文件系统写入权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q2/0057.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1144","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/56b9e9b42ce0a91a448094549973b81cdf8e832e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0318.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0318","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0318.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/61756b9c4d4c30577cc003b0b28e3db71ca30a1e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0318.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-f4mw-6gjr-pj7w/GHSA-f4mw-6gjr-pj7w.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mercure_imap_read_any_file.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0318.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf3