oad/details.aspx?FamilyId=F403EC53-9726-42A1-AAAC-95772ED06A9A），Windows 2000 用户安装对应补丁（下载地址 https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=2D8C75EA-01FA-45CE-A448-4AFE869D1782）。如无法立即打补丁，临时缓解措施为：限制远程用户执行批处理脚本的权限，避免向 CMD.EXE 传递超长环境变量参数。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0147.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1135","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-027","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0331.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0331","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0331.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2c577e1255b2c3fd617b7f1c499a222feb7b668/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0331.json","https://github.com/biggerwing/nsfocus-rsas-knowledge-base/blob/156208b301d4649ead13cd15f827830d08245b89/example","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/db909d46c3d9b98ec1f95daa3c88d7a8990ea8f5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qjvx-wh8v-928g/GHSA-qjvx-wh8v-928g.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0331.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--72481ae7-0229-4d43-ae7d-7e12d475e6a5.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0332.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0302","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0302.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0311","title":"Microsoft Windows 2000 域控制器活动目录属性访问控制漏洞","description":"Windows 2000 域控制器存在未受保护属性访问漏洞（Mixed Object Access），由于 Active Directory 中部分对象属性缺少适当的访问控制机制，导致已获得域内低权限认证的攻击者能够修改目录对象的关键属性。攻击者可通过 LDAP 协议向域控制器发送特制查询请求，利用未受保护的属性修改用户权限、组成员关系或对象安全描述符，从而提升权限或绕过访问控制策略。该漏洞影响 Windows 2000 Server 及 Advanced Server 版本，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低，但结合其他漏洞可能造成更大安全风险。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0311"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:27.110","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 于 2000 年 4 月发布的 MS00-026 安全更新补丁，下载地址为 https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=7237F230-A28B-447B-9034-6654DD7CD05E。如无法安装补丁，应严格限制对域控制器的网络访问权限，仅允许受信任管理员登录，并启用 Active Directory 审核日志以监控异常属性修改行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1145","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-026","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9342e5394ee109ffc3617b5105797cdfcfcb78cf/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0311.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0311","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0311.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0311.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9gxv-q965-2873/GHSA-9gxv-q965-2873.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0311.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001305.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/a3d797a054f33a26fc99648a4e1cc47b2bce8d08/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0302.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0243","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0243.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0268","title":"Cisco IOS Telnet Daemon 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 11.x 及 12.x 版本的 Telnet 守护进程存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者在未完成 Telnet 连接建立前，向目标设备发送特制的 ENVIRON 选项参数，可触发该守护进程崩溃并导致系统重启。攻击无需任何身份认证，且 Cisco IOS 系列设备广泛部署于企业及运营商网络，影响范围极大。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0268"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:21.700","remediation":"升级 Cisco IOS 至 12.0.8 或更高版本。若无法立即升级，可在受影响设备上禁用 Telnet 服务（no service telnet），改用 SSH 远程管理，或通过访问控制列表（ACL）限制 Telnet 访问源地址作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/iostelnetopt-pub.shtml","http://www.osvdb.org/1289","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1123","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0268.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a54ce91ca4eed5acb1176739213f8ac035b9fa27/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0268.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0268","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2000.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0268.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c